   :description "GET /partials/branch-popover — top-bar branch chip popover body (sorted list + create input + error slot). Auth-gated: branch enumeration mirrors `/api/branches`. Click handlers in `editor-branches.js` bind via `data-branch-name` / `data-merge-source` / `data-diff-source` attrs the partial emits; 401 is surfaced by the same inline-error path as the legacy fetch."
